# Place your Google Cloud service account JSON key here as:
#   google-service-account.json
#
# IMPORTANT: "APP SYSTEM FILES" must live on a Shared Drive (not My Drive).
# Service accounts have 0 My Drive quota — they create empty folders but cannot
# upload Excel files. Add the service account email as Content Manager, then set:
#   GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_FILE=../credentials/google-service-account.json
#   GOOGLE_DRIVE_ROOT_FOLDER_ID=<folder-id-from-Drive-URL>
#
# Do NOT commit the actual JSON key to git.
